    "This looks like a card or bank statement, which isn't read as one bill. Fill it in by hand." : {
      "comment" : "Split a bill: the photo is a card or bank statement, which isn't read as one bill",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يبدو هذا كشف بطاقة أو كشف حساب بنكي، ولا يُقرأ كفاتورة واحدة. يمكنك الإدخال يدويًا."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das sieht nach einer Karten- oder Kontoabrechnung aus, die nicht als eine Rechnung gelesen wird. Fülle es von Hand aus."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
